<div class="wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-e710d7bd">
<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"gnome","style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<h2 id="gnome" class="wp-block-heading" style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0">A Gnome who talks back, and remembers.</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0">Walk up to the Gnome and he&#039;ll talk: deadpan, a little world-weary, and always about to sit down. Pick a reply, or type or say your own words and he&#039;ll answer them.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0">He remembers who you are from one visit to the next, and a grown-up can see everything he remembers about each player, and make him forget it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:uagb/container -->
</div></div>
<!-- /wp:uagb/container -->
